    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk im just really nervous about going to the er... it sounds so dramatic and i dont have a headache or anything. if it were a stroke wouldn't i feel more sick? it feels like it might just be a nerve thing. do u think it's safe to just wait a day or two and see if it goes away on its own?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
