    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that but the er is so expensive and honestly... i just feel fine otherwise. no dizziness, no numbness in my arms, nothing. it really just seems like a localized facial thing. if i were to just take some vitamins or maybe some ibuprofen to see if the inflammation goes down, would that be a bad idea? i'd rather just manage it at home for now if u think it's likely just bells palsy.",
